{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56538","headline":"还丹歌 七 · 杨行真人","name":"还丹歌 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"铅汞二阴，还丹之心。\n相制不难，人迷不寻。\n学者不见，徒费千金。\n堪得指教，作福拯贫。\n如斯之用，天人不嗔。\n非道破除，天之大怒。\n恶病加之，遭官刑狱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨行真人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56538.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56538","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}